<P STYLE="text-indent:0pt; text-align: left; font-family: serif; font-size: 10pt; line-height: 12pt; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: normal; text-transform: none; padding-top: 3pt; padding-right: 0pt; padding-left: 4px; padding-bottom: 3pt; margin-top: 0pt; margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt">organization consisting of Chief Executive Officers. Mr. Garcia and his companies also support News in Education, Adopt-A-School Program, The Kids&#146; Wish Network, The Special Olympics, Florida Institute of Community Studies, Junior Achievement, and Cattle Baron&#146;s Ball, a charity event sponsored by the American Cancer Society. </P>

<P STYLE="text-indent:20px; text-align: left; font-family: serif; font-size: 10pt; line-height: 12pt; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: normal; text-transform: none; padding-top: 3pt; padding-right: 0pt; padding-left: 4px; padding-bottom: 3pt; margin-top: 0pt; margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt">Please also see the section entitled &#147;Management&#148; in this prospectus. </P>

<H2 STYLE="text-indent:0pt; text-align: left; font-family: serif; font-size: 10pt; line-height: 12pt; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: bold; text-transform: none; padding-top: 5pt; padding-right: 0pt; padding-left: 4px; padding-bottom: 3pt; margin-top: 0pt; margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt">Q: Who is, and what is the role of, your advisor? </H2>

<P STYLE="text-indent:0pt; text-align: left; font-family: serif; font-size: 10pt; line-height: 12pt; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: normal; text-transform: none; padding-top: 3pt; padding-right: 0pt; padding-left: 4px; padding-bottom: 3pt; margin-top: 0pt; margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt">A: Our advisor is Carter/Validus Advisors, LLC. Carter/Validus Advisors, LLC is responsible for managing our day-to-day operations and our assets. Carter/Validus Advisors, LLC also will make recommendations for all of our investment decisions, which will be subject to the approval of our board of directors, subject to certain exceptions as discussed further in the section entitled &#147;Summary of Our Organizational Documents&#148; in this prospectus. </P>

<H2 STYLE="text-indent:0pt; text-align: left; font-family: serif; font-size: 10pt; line-height: 12pt; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: bold; text-transform: none; padding-top: 5pt; padding-right: 0pt; padding-left: 4px; padding-bottom: 3pt; margin-top: 0pt; margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt">Q: What is the role of your board of directors? </H2>

<P STYLE="text-indent:0pt; text-align: left; font-family: serif; font-size: 10pt; line-height: 12pt; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: normal; text-transform: none; padding-top: 3pt; padding-right: 0pt; padding-left: 4px; padding-bottom: 3pt; margin-top: 0pt; margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt">A: We operate under the direction of our board of directors, the members of which are accountable to us and our stockholders as fiduciaries. Our board of directors is comprised of five members, three of whom are independent of our advisor and its affiliates. A majority of our independent directors will be responsible for reviewing the performance of our advisor and approving certain other matters as set forth in our charter. Our directors are elected annually by our stockholders. </P>

<H2 STYLE="text-indent:0pt; text-align: left; font-family: serif; font-size: 10pt; line-height: 12pt; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: bold; text-transform: none; padding-top: 5pt; padding-right: 0pt; padding-left: 4px; padding-bottom: 3pt; margin-top: 0pt; margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt">Q: How will the payment of fees and expenses affect my invested capital? </H2>

<P STYLE="text-indent:0pt; text-align: left; font-family: serif; font-size: 10pt; line-height: 12pt; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: normal; text-transform: none; padding-top: 3pt; padding-right: 0pt; padding-left: 4px; padding-bottom: 3pt; margin-top: 0pt; margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt">A: We will pay sales commissions and dealer manager fees in connection with this offering. In addition, we will reimburse our advisor for our organization and offering expenses not to exceed, together with the dealer manager fees and selling commissions, 15% of the gross proceeds of our offering. We estimate such organization and offering expenses will be approximately 1.25% of the gross offering proceeds raised if we sell the maximum number of shares in our primary offering. If we do not raise the minimum amount of the offering, we will not reimburse our advisor for our organization and offering expenses. We will also pay our advisor acquisition fees
for substantial services provided in the acquisition of investments. The payment of fees and expenses will reduce the funds available to us for investment in real estate and real estate-related assets. </P>

<H2 STYLE="text-indent:0pt; text-align: left; font-family: serif; font-size: 10pt; line-height: 12pt; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: bold; text-transform: none; padding-top: 5pt; padding-right: 0pt; padding-left: 4px; padding-bottom: 3pt; margin-top: 0pt; margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt">Q: Do you currently have any shares outstanding? </H2>

<P STYLE="text-indent:0pt; text-align: left; font-family: serif; font-size: 10pt; line-height: 12pt; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: normal; text-transform: none; padding-top: 3pt; padding-right: 0pt; padding-left: 4px; padding-bottom: 3pt; margin-top: 0pt; margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt">A: Yes. We have sold 20,000 shares of our common stock to Carter/Validus REIT Investment Management, LLC for an aggregate purchase price of $200,000 and intend to contribute the proceeds from that sale to Carter/Validus Operating Partnership, LP, our operating partnership, for which we intend to acquire 20,000 general partnership units of the operating partnership. </P>

<H2 STYLE="text-indent:0pt; text-align: left; font-family: serif; font-size: 10pt; line-height: 12pt; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: bold; text-transform: none; padding-top: 5pt; padding-right: 0pt; padding-left: 4px; padding-bottom: 3pt; margin-top: 0pt; margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt">Q: Do you currently own any real estate? </H2>

<P STYLE="text-indent:0pt; text-align: left; font-family: serif; font-size: 10pt; line-height: 12pt; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: normal; text-transform: none; padding-top: 3pt; padding-right: 0pt; padding-left: 4px; padding-bottom: 3pt; margin-top: 0pt; margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt">A: We do not currently own any properties or other real estate investments and have not identified any specific assets to acquire. Because we have not yet identified any specific assets to acquire, we are considered a blind pool. Because we do not and have not owned any properties or real estate investments, you do not need to be concerned about possible &#147;legacy issues&#148; related to assets acquired before the commencement of this offering. As specific investments become probable, we will supplement this prospectus to provide information regarding the probable investment to the extent it is material to an investment decision with respect to our
common stock. We also will describe material changes to our portfolio, including the closing of property acquisitions, by means of a supplement to this prospectus. </P>

<H2 STYLE="text-indent:0pt; text-align: left; font-family: serif; font-size: 10pt; line-height: 12pt; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: bold; text-transform: none; padding-top: 5pt; padding-right: 0pt; padding-left: 4px; padding-bottom: 3pt; margin-top: 0pt; margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt">Q: How do you plan to structure the ownership and operation of your assets? </H2>

<P STYLE="text-indent:0pt; text-align: left; font-family: serif; font-size: 10pt; line-height: 12pt; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: normal; text-transform: none; padding-top: 3pt; padding-right: 0pt; padding-left: 4px; padding-bottom: 3pt; margin-top: 0pt; margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt">A: We plan to own substantially all our assets and conduct our operations through an operating partnership named Carter/Validus Operating Partnership, LP. We are the sole general partner of Carter/Validus Operating Partnership, LP. This structure is commonly referred to as an &#147;umbrella partnership REIT,&#148; or &#147;UPREIT,&#148; structure. We refer to Carter/Validus Operating Partnership, LP as the &#147;operating partnership&#148; and to partnership interests and special partnership interests in the operating partnership as &#147;OP Units&#148; and &#147;Special </P>

</DIV>

