meetings of our board of directors. If a director also is an employee of Carter/Validus Advisors, LLC or its affiliates, we do not pay compensation for services rendered as a director. </P>

<H2 STYLE="text-indent:0pt; text-align: left; font-family: serif; font-size: 10pt; line-height: 12pt; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: bold; text-transform: none; padding-top: 5pt; padding-right: 0pt; padding-left: 4px; padding-bottom: 3pt; margin-top: 0pt; margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt">Restricted Share Plan </H2>

