          <TD STYLE="width: 24px; text-align: left">&#149;</TD>

          <TD STYLE="text-align: left">If an investment opportunity becomes available that is suitable, under all of the factors considered by Carter/Validus Advisors, LLC, for both us and one or more other entities affiliated with Carter/Validus Advisors, LLC, and for which more than one of such entities has sufficient uninvested funds, then the entity that has had the longest period of time elapse since it was offered an investment opportunity will first be offered such investment opportunity. It will be the duty of our board of directors, including the independent directors, to insure that this method is reasonable and applied fairly to us. In determining whether or not an investment opportunity is suitable for more than one program, Carter/Validus Advisors, LLC, subject to approval by our board of directors, shall examine, among others, the following factors: </TD>

