<H1 STYLE="text-indent:0pt; text-align: center; font-family: serif; font-size: 10pt; line-height: 12pt; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: bold; text-transform: none; padding-top: 9pt; padding-right: 0pt; padding-left: 0pt; padding-bottom: 3pt; margin-top: 0pt; margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt"><a name="#tSFD"></a>SELECTED FINANCIAL DATA </H1>

<P STYLE="text-indent:20px; text-align: left; font-family: serif; font-size: 10pt; line-height: 12pt; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: normal; text-transform: none; padding-top: 3pt; padding-right: 0pt; padding-left: 4px; padding-bottom: 3pt; margin-top: 0pt; margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt">As of the date of this prospectus, we have not yet had any operations. As of December 31, 2009, the only asset we held was cash of $200,000. The valuation of this amount does not require estimates or judgment by management. Therefore, we have not had any income, cash flow, funds from operations, or funds available for distributions, nor have we declared any distributions or issued any shares to public investors. We have sold 20,000 shares to Carter/Validus REIT Investment Management, LLC for an aggregate purchase price of $200,000 and intend to contribute the proceeds from that sale to the operating partnership, for which we intend to acquire 20,000
general partnership units of the operating partnership. See the section entitled &#147;Management&#146;s Discussion and Analysis of Financial Condition and Results of Operations,&#148; and our financial statements and related notes thereto, appearing elsewhere in this prospectus. </P>

</DIV>

<P STYLE="width: 708px; text-indent:0px; text-align: center; font-family: serif; font-size: 10pt; line-height: 12pt; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: normal; color: black; text-transform: none; text-decoration: none; padding-top: 12pt; padding-right: 0pt; padding-left: 0pt; padding-bottom: 3pt; margin-top: 0pt; margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt">124</P>

