          <TD STYLE="width: 24px; text-align: left">&#149;</TD>

          <TD STYLE="text-align: left">prior to the time of such reinvestment, the participant has received the final prospectus and any supplements thereto offering interests in the subsequent program sponsored by affiliates of our advisor and such prospectus allows investments pursuant to a distribution reinvestment plan; </TD>

</TR>

