          <TD STYLE="width: 24px; text-align: left">&#149;</TD>

          <TD STYLE="text-align: left">amend our charter, including, without limitation, amendments to provisions relating to director qualifications, fiduciary duty, liability and indemnification, conflicts of interest, investment policies or investment restrictions, except for amendments with respect to increases or decreases in the </TD>

</TR>

</TABLE>

