          <TD STYLE="text-align: left">make or invest in any mortgage loans, if the transaction is with our advisor, any director or any of their affiliates, unless an appraisal is obtained concerning the underlying property from an independent appraiser except for those loans insured or guaranteed by a government or government </TD>

</TR>

</TABLE>

