          <TD STYLE="width: 24px; text-align: left">&#149;</TD>

          <TD STYLE="text-align: left">to file a voluntary petition seeking liquidation, reorganization, arrangement or readjustment, in any form, of the partnership&#146;s debts under Title 11 of the United States Bankruptcy Code, or any other federal or state insolvency law, or corresponding provisions of future laws, or file an answer consenting to or acquiescing in any such petition or </TD>

