          <TD ROWSPAN=1 COLSPAN=1 STYLE="text-align: left">Reimbursement of acquisition expenses incurred in the process of acquiring properties or other real estate-related investments (including expenses relating to potential investments that we do not close), such as legal fees and expenses, costs of real estate due diligence, travel and communications expenses, accounting fees and expenses and other closing costs. The Company expects these expenses will be approximately 0.5% of the purchase price of each property or real estate-related investment.</TD>

