          <TD ROWSPAN=1 COLSPAN=1 STYLE="text-align: left">5.0% of the cost of the projects, repairs and/or rehabilitation, as applicable, for acting as general contractor and/or construction manager to supervise or coordinate projects or to provide major repairs or rehabilitation for the Company&#146;s properties.</TD>

