          <TD ROWSPAN=1 COLSPAN=1 STYLE="text-align: left">For substantial assistance in connection with the sale of properties, the Company will pay the Advisor a real estate commission up to the lesser of 1.5% of the contract sales price and one-half of the total brokerage commission paid if a third party broker is also involved; provided, however, that in no event may the real estate commissions paid to the Advisor, its affiliates and unaffiliated third parties exceed the lesser of 6% of the contract sales price and a reasonable, customary and competitive real estate commission in light of the size, type and location of the property. Substantial assistance in connection with the sale of an asset includes the Advisor&#146;s preparation of an investment package for an asset (including an investment analysis, and asset description and other due diligence information) or such other substantial services performed by the Advisor in connection with a sale. The Advisor may elect to have
these fees paid, in whole or in part, in cash or OP Units.</TD>

</TR>

<TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">

          <TD STYLE="padding-left: 10pt; text-indent: -10pt" ROWSPAN=1 COLSPAN=1>Subordinated Participation in Net Sale Process&nbsp;&#151;&nbsp;Advisor (payable only if the<BR> Company&#146;s stock is not listed on an exchange)</TD>

          <TD STYLE="width: 12px; vertical-align: text-bottom; text-align: center; border-bottom: none" ROWSPAN=1><!-- GUTTER -->&nbsp;</TD>

          <TD ROWSPAN=1 COLSPAN=1 STYLE="text-align: left">As incentive compensation, the advisor will receive 15% of remaining net sale proceeds after return of capital contributions plus payment to investors of an 8% cumulative, pre-tax, non-compounded return on the capital contributed by investors.</TD>

</TR>

<TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">

          <TD STYLE="padding-left: 10pt; text-indent: -10pt" ROWSPAN=1 COLSPAN=1>Subordinated Incentive Listing Fee&nbsp;&#151;&nbsp;Advisor<BR>(payable only if the Company&#146;s stock is listed on an exchange)</TD>

          <TD STYLE="width: 12px; vertical-align: text-bottom; text-align: center; border-bottom: none" ROWSPAN=1><!-- GUTTER -->&nbsp;</TD>

          <TD ROWSPAN=1 COLSPAN=1 STYLE="text-align: left">As incentive compensation, the advisor will receive 15% of the amount by which the sum of the Company&#146;s adjusted market value plus distributions exceeds the sum of the aggregate capital contributed by investors plus an amount equal to an 8% cumulative, pre-tax, non-compounded annual return to investors.</TD>

</TR>

<TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">

          <TD STYLE="padding-left: 10pt; text-indent: -10pt" ROWSPAN=1 COLSPAN=1>Subordinated Termination Fee</TD>

          <TD STYLE="width: 12px; vertical-align: text-bottom; text-align: center; border-bottom: none" ROWSPAN=1><!-- GUTTER -->&nbsp;</TD>

          <TD ROWSPAN=1 COLSPAN=1 STYLE="text-align: left">Upon termination or non-renewal of the Advisory Agreement, the Advisor shall be entitled to a subordinated termination fee. In addition, the Advisor may elect to defer its right to receive a subordinated termination fee until either a listing on a national securities exchange or other liquidity event occurs.</TD>

