          <TD STYLE="width: 1px"></TD>

          <TD STYLE="width: 24px; text-align: left">&#149;</TD>

          <TD STYLE="text-align: left"><I>Misuse of TINs</I>.&nbsp;&nbsp;If the requester discloses or uses taxpayer identification numbers in violation of Federal law, the payer may be subject to civil and criminal penalties. </TD>

</TR>

</TABLE>

<H1 STYLE="text-indent:0pt; text-align: center; font-family: serif; font-size: 10pt; line-height: 12pt; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: bold; text-transform: none; padding-top: 9pt; padding-right: 0pt; padding-left: 0pt; padding-bottom: 3pt; margin-top: 0pt; margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt">FOR ADDITIONAL INFORMATION CONTACT YOUR TAX CONSULTANT OR THE IRS.</H1>

